#Протокол_Memory_Contract_V1<[
Базис:
  define-memory-contract задаёт границы памяти до полной реализации writers/readers; protocols/project-memory-v1.bvc уже описывает MemoryRecord v1 kinds and lifecycle.
  Memory must not become prompt stuffing or hidden chat transcript storage.
Вектор:
  Разделить storage roles: source_of_truth (.bvc memory atoms + Work Graph), derived_cache (JSON snapshot/export), session_runtime (provider transient context), external_evidence (command logs, test reports, imported artifacts).
  Описать write events: done/verified task, worker-run evidence, verification result, blocker resolution, explicit human decision, domain adapter import.
  Описать context budget: memorySlice for agent worker is bounded by record count, char budget and type priority (invariants/decisions > domain facts > open questions).
Цель:
  Агент получает полезную память проекта без чтения всего репозитория.

Проверки:
  есть список memory entity
  есть write policy
  есть context budget policy

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  protocol.id: memory-contract-v1
  work.source: define-memory-contract
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Storage_Roles<[
Базис:
  Смешение canonical state и cache снова приводит к non-rebuildable agent context.
Вектор:
  source_of_truth: .bvc Work Graph atoms and Project Memory atoms; human-readable authoring; only policy-gated transitions change task status.
  derived_cache: workgraph.snapshot.v1, operator-dashboard.snapshot.v1, verification.summary.v1, future graph/RAG JSON; rebuildable from .bvc canon.
  session_runtime: provider conversation, tool call scratchpad, partial patches; ephemeral; never required to reconstruct done/blocked state.
  external_evidence: command stdout/stderr summaries, test reports, diff artifacts; referenced by Evidence Record v1 and summarized in memory evidence-summary types.
Цель:
  Each layer has one authority and a rebuild path.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: memory-storage-roles-v1
  protocol.id: memory-contract-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Write_Policy<[
Базис:
  Memory writes must trace back to Work Graph events, not model improvisation.
Вектор:
  Write on: task transition to done/verified with evidence; successful/failed verification command; worker-run with structured output; human manual-review approval; domain adapter structured import.
  Do not write on: casual chat, unverified model claims, full file copies, raw provider transcripts.
  New records default to draft or needs-review unless evidenceIds and sourceWorkItem are present and verification passed.
  Supersede/retire instead of silent delete when decision or invariant changes.
Цель:
  Memory accumulates durable context with provenance.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: memory-write-policy-v1
  protocol.id: memory-contract-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Context_Budget_Policy<[
Базис:
  Unbounded memory slice defeats the purpose of structured Project Memory.
Вектор:
  Default agent memorySlice limits: max 12 records, max 4000 chars total summary text, max 8 relatedFiles refs.
  Priority order when truncating: invariant, decision, architecture-fact, domain-fact, evidence-summary, risk, open-question, provider-capability, user-preference.
  Include only records linked to current task id, targetFiles overlap, or explicit operator focus tags.
  Session_runtime and derived_cache full dumps never injected wholesale into Worker Input v1.
Цель:
  Agent context stays bounded and relevant to current WorkItem.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: memory-context-budget-v1
  protocol.id: memory-contract-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Memory_Entity_Summary<[
Базис:
  define-memory-contract needs a concise entity list aligned with project-memory-v1.
Вектор:
  Entities map to MemoryRecord v1 types: decision, invariant, domain-fact, architecture-fact, risk, open-question, evidence-summary, provider-capability, user-preference.
  Each entity requires id, type, summary, sourceWorkItem, status, confidence, updatedAt; optional evidenceIds, relatedFiles, relatedTasks, BVC links.
  Writers and readers contracts detailed in protocols/project-memory-v1.bvc; this contract fixes boundaries and budgets only.
Цель:
  Single vocabulary for memory tasks, dashboard and agent worker without duplicate models.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: memory-entity-summary-v1
  protocol.id: memory-contract-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>
